{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nhC1nukGJn7AK-fxxIVwcA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:12.121595+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nhC1nukGJn7AK-fxxIVwcA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>点击</span></span><b><span>蓝字</span></b><span><span>关注我们</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>培养单位介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.1</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/fFgUJknhibCyXfib19pfFmuia2Nftj3p2FQrJytGVRsVZ4H31ibhQnsx4C4GdIBNyza2DU11jxV45PWicgBIfUWAcicGXM8FPgTaibv/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/fFgUJknhibCyXfib19pfFmuia2Nftj3p2FQ4MWgfSuZYpCAw1HvIqeKBjdGWuMMIPQ9BFmH5J1tLTqa1Ha0BNYcynb5gt9iaRJcX/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>珠海市人民医院</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZV1trMrD6oZlPvyp27mMBPicJT6c1SmhGIxIeiaAL5yVxcz3iaAMfbx8Xg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>珠海市人民医院作为珠海首家公立医院，建院至今已历七十余载，是暨南大学珠海临床医学院、澳门科技大学医学院第一附属医院、北京理工大学附属医院及中央干部保健基地，是集医教研、保健及科创转化于一体的大型综合三甲医院。2019年在市政府支持下成立珠海市人民医院医疗集团，医疗服务覆盖珠海陆地及海岛全域。现为广东省级区域医疗中心、广东省高水平医院重点建设单位、全省公立医院改革与高质量发展示范单位，国家三级公立医院考核（国考）成绩稳居A+（全国前10%，广东省第十）。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZFQJcOAqhLnluamlYa4Xws5KHNtlc0sSTaF3icTUEXglIxvAiaDbtmE6g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZGVIV2UoHRH3wwNnDxVKk0CDjl6dl6FTiafCf2M1OY5CL4hLHLOLQstw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>坚持卓越，打造高水平学科组群。医院整合院士高水平人才团队，聚焦精准微创与疑难重症，打造高水平临床专科与科创平台。现有清华大学智慧医疗研究院、省肿瘤介入诊治重点实验室、省临床转化创新平台等国家和省级创新科学研究平台。拥有珠海首个国家级临床重点专科——医学影像中心（涵盖介入放射、放射诊断、核医学、超声影像、放射治疗五个专科），9个省级临床重点专科、21个市级临床重点专科。是国家级妇科肿瘤诊疗规范/示范中心、国家卫健委“一带一路”妇科内镜医师培训基地、国家高血压达标中心、中国心衰中心、国家高级认知障碍诊疗中心等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>服务至上，不断创新服务模式。以“紧密型城市医疗集团+澳珠医疗联合体”为基筑，医院搭建多元化、国际化、定制化的共享医疗服务平台，长期探索建立港澳珠医疗健康共建共享机制，率先开通港澳转诊绿色通道，是珠海唯一具有“港澳药械通”资质授权的三甲医院，并与澳门大学共建珠海市精准医学诊疗中心，与澳门科技大学共建国际医学中心等，实现港澳医师互聘。同时，依托集团成员单位横琴专科医院、市养老中心积极推进多项国际化特色专科延伸服务，立足澳珠、服务湾区，促进优质医疗资源的共享与交流，推助粤港澳大湾区医疗教育、研究、管理领域走向纵深。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZA2p9iafeCWwSfvBI8zRHnKsjWjunEREI4CjkYoxz1okUz5JZTl0htqA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>向上滑动查看更多</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>培养单位介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>师资力量方面，医院现已建成一支高水平、结构化、跨学科的导师团队。目前共有博士研究生导师10名、硕导91名，均为临床及科研一线领军专家，覆盖放射影像学、介入放射学、内分泌与代谢病、肾脏病学、心血管内科、妇产科学、骨科学、肿瘤学、核医学及免疫学等重要方向。他们在各自领域具有深厚的学术造诣和丰富的指导经验，能为研究生提供高水平的科研平台与临床实践支持。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>请点击查看珠海市人民医院官网-导师风采页面：</span></p><p><span>https://www.zhhospital.cn/category/dsfsyxk.html</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免招生信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>现正式启动2026年推荐免试研究生招生工作，欢迎全国高校优秀应届本科毕业生申请。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZJEpJ3gaEoxym5aIckqyAWmhtJzmNYV31JI7BY9qrhsp4mS8J11ShsA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/fFgUJknhibCyXfib19pfFmuia2Nftj3p2FQ4nvlUqGmWic2HEbQ7UIVLGbx9YQMMOUvsUN0aqX8Pqic79AtXTIffTfDR1NGQPCz1A/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZQ9AkHCt7mffMLPH41mx4JInUBrQxiaFPG5a8rggpDgxdBXxRVDQ4ib3g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>【申请对象】</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>大陆高校优秀应届本科推免生</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>【申请条件】</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 已获得本科所在学校推荐免试资格；</span></p><p><span>2. 身心健康，综合素质优秀；</span></p><p><span>3. 具备良好的科研素养与学术潜质；</span></p><p><span>4. 原则上申请专业应与本科毕业专业同属一个一级学科，若跨一级学科需按要求提供附加材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>【报名安排】</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>报名时间：2025年8月21日—9月14日</span></p><p><span>报名方式：登录暨南大学研究生招生信息网→推免生报名系统，填写并提交申请</span></p><p><span>复试时间：9月17日—9月19日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>【提交材料】</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>相关材料扫描电子版在报名系统中提交，清单如下：</span></p><p><span>（一）《暨南大学2026年接收优秀推荐免试攻读硕士研究生申请表》，报名系统填报信息后生成申请表，须申请人签名；</span></p><p><span>（二）在校历年学习成绩表，加盖推荐学校教务处公章；</span></p><p><span>（三）国家英语四级或六级考试成绩；</span></p><p><span>（四）本人学生证；</span></p><p><span>（五）证明学生本人在科研方面有突出表现的学术论文等原创性成果材料（该材料不作为必须提供材料，供复试专家组参考）。</span></p><p><span>详细招生信息请查阅（或直接点击下方原文链接）：</span></p><p><span>https://yz.jnu.edu.cn/2025/0721/c33059a840936/page.htm</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>【培养待遇】</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>医院为研究生提供具有竞争力的奖助体系，包括生活补助、伙食补贴、夜班补助等，并可安排参加国家住院医师规范化培训，优秀毕业生有机会留院或推荐至国内知名医疗机构工作。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>咨询电话：0756-2162086（吴老师）、0756-2157697（梁老师）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZOkVfwjE2ibVcuWLACSdoXfX3m1o37pP4PtzQQtARckrPRrVKEibcdEGQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>我们诚挚邀请有志于医学事业的优秀学子加入珠医大家庭，在这里扬帆启航，追逐卓越，共同投身粤港澳大湾区健康事业发展！</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>撰稿：吴嘉欣</span></p><p><span>编辑：梁蕊</span></p><p><span>校对：梁蕊</span></p><p><span>审稿专家：梁文凯</span></p><p><span>复审：殷贝</span></p><p><span>审核发布：崔敏</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZpOibDHBpsMwK7ao8HABxQVUnAia2rmNRyZwmWjCVDNLqdYBKLHb1kKHQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>分享</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZpOibDHBpsMwK7ao8HABxQVUnAia2rmNRyZwmWjCVDNLqdYBKLHb1kKHQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>点赞</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/aQZbJGPCg9icGh1lvytfzh7N7rufvgFFZpOibDHBpsMwK7ao8HABxQVUnAia2rmNRyZwmWjCVDNLqdYBKLHb1kKHQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>在看</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ee2d80bf811e4ce80497b84a245269c70654b04fe8f3b797a19e0d2a15eed364","textLength":1770,"sourceSha256":"0dd60342ecd8b47534614c701c92b9922e97afcf0ef580be6dc33bc78fd72d7a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c98d0f5b7cdd43dae482","title":"2025年暨南大学珠海临床医学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:12.121595+00:00"}
